果价值更高，且能增长两节。","Hazards":"障碍","Walls, rocks, hedges, and your own body end the round. Plan ahead — you cannot reverse.":"墙壁、岩石、树篱和你自己的身体结束了这一轮。提前计划——你无法逆转。","Small rivals":"小对手","Golden rivals are prey: catch any part of one with your head to defeat it for a big bonus.":"黄金对手是猎物：用你的头抓住猎物的任何部分来击败它以获得巨额奖金。","Big rivals":"强大对手","Dark plated rivals hunt you. Any contact is fatal. They telegraph by shape: spikes mean danger.":"深色装甲的对手在追捕你。任何接触都是致命的。它们通过形状发出警告：尖刺意味着危险。","Each round lists its goals. Complete all of them to win; finishing under par earns bonus points.":"每轮都会列出其目标。完成所有目标即可获胜；低于标准杆完成可获得奖励分数。","Undo & hints":"撤销与提示","Undo ({undo}) and hints ({hint}) are available in Practice. Pause with {pause}.":"撤消({undo})和提示({hint})在实践中可用。使用 {pause} 暂停。","Scoring":"计分","Score = food + growth + rival defeats + survival + objectives. Ties break on completion, then fewer invalid moves, then faster time.":"分数=食物+成长+对手失败+生存+目标。平局在完成时打破，然后无效动作更少，然后时间更快。","Replay tutorials":"重放教程","← Back":"← 返回","Achievements":"成就","Cosmetics":"外观装饰","Cosmetics change looks only — never hitboxes, timing, or power.":"外观只改变外观——绝不改变判定框、时机或强度。","{name} ({cost} mastery)":"{name}（{cost}精通）","Open journey map":"开放旅程地图","Display name":"显示名称","Save":"保存","Casual board — offline scores are not server-validated.":"休闲棋盘——离线分数未经服务器验证。","No scores yet. Be the first!":"暂无得分。成为第一个！","seed {seed}":"种子 {seed}","golden berry at column {x}, row {y}":"金色浆果位于 {x} 列、{y} 行","berry at column {x}, row {y}":"浆果位于 {x} 列、{y} 行","hunter at column {x}, row {y}":"猎人在{x}列、{y}行","Arena {w} by {h}. Serpent length {len}, heading {dir}, head at column {x}, row {y}.":"竞技场 {w}×{h}。蛇长度 {len}，朝向 {dir}，头部位于第 {x} 列，第 {y} 行。","Food: {list}.":"食物：{list}。","none":"无","Threats: {list}":"威胁：{list}","No hunters.":"没有猎人。","Ranked":"排名","Unranked":"非排名","Morning Meadow":"早晨草地","Sunset Orchard":"日落果园","Moonlit Pond":"月光池塘","Autumn Hollow":"秋谷","Coral Dunes":"珊瑚沙丘","First Slither":"第一滑行者","Berry Trail":"浆果小径","Long Way Round":"漫长绕行","Mastery: The O