s.":"在大型对手徘徊时击败 4 个小型对手。","Golden Only":"仅限金色","Score 400 with golden berries everywhere.":"得分 400，到处都是金色浆果。","The Gauntlet":"挑战试炼","Survive 300 ticks with two hunters.":"与两名猎人一起在 300 只蜱虫中生存。","Relaxed":"轻松","Steady":"稳定","Brisk":"轻快","Fierce":"激烈","The round is already over.":"回合已结束。","Unknown direction.":"方向未知。","The serpent cannot reverse into itself.":"蛇不能反转到自身。","Command is not an object.":"命令不是对象。","Unknown command type.":"未知的命令类型。","Low thud — serpent down":"低沉的撞击声——蛇倒下","Guest Gardener":"客座园丁","Bramble":"荆棘","Moss":"莫斯","Thistle":"蓟","{name} (spirit)":"{name}(精神)","That move is not legal.":"该步棋不合法。","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"已从您的 StarHermit 云存档恢复进度。","Close panel":"关闭面板","Close":"关闭","Angled garden view":"倾斜的花园景观","Top-down view":"自顶向下视图","Sound, graphics, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"声音、图形、语言、更大文本、高对比度和减少动态效果均在 StarHermit 选项中。","Open Options":"打开选项","Key bindings":"按键绑定","Graphics":"图形","Camera view":"相机视角"}
